{
  "name": "ondra-tts-gate",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的语音四道闸门（手册 §9.4 自研档）：开关、6–30 字、情绪强度 ≥0.15（或本轮有情绪词）、3 秒频控，外加「连续两条后强制留文本」。只做判定、不发声也不合成：判定结果带原因码、真实字数、情绪强度与六态语速，由对话链接到 O-050。缺情绪服务时按降级放行并在结果里标明，缺合成通道时如实报 unavailable——两种失败方向相反，是刻意的。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
